OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAreas of cloud and outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain across England and Wales clearing
OL,7,Fto the northeast by early afternoon,
OL,8,Fwith fine, sunny and warm or very warm
OL,9,Fweather following. Scotland and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland rather windy and
OL,11,Fcloudy with occasional rain throughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud and rain across
OL,14,FScotland and Northern Ireland clearing
OL,15,Finto England and Wales but weakening
OL,16,Fas it does so. Fine and dry ahead of
OL,17,Fit with a few showers following.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
