OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FApart from some early rain,
OL,6,Fsouthern and central areas will be
OL,7,Flargely dry and bright until late.
OL,8,FOtherwise, rain followed by showers
OL,9,Fmoving southeastwards, with gales
OL,10,Ftowards the northwest.
